REA source-guided ASAR checks
https://github.com/morluto/rea/tree/96ea32b7e4e28d3c9cd79a1de4b8e1ba3b4244e9

The declared SHA-256 metadata admission and packed-member range checks in
src/eaos/application.py were developed with reference to
src/artifacts/AsarArtifactReader.ts at the revision above. The upstream
notice below is retained for these narrow source-guided portions, not as
attribution of the entire module. Additional policy, captured-byte verification,
bounded traversal, transport and input captures are EAOS implementations.
REA's runtime and tests are not bundled.

